<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-081" chapter-id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry" source-id="s-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry-ws2069213">
  <p id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0000" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t_*AAA">顧覬之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0004" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t_*AAA">偉仁</persName>，吳郡吳人也。高祖<persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0015" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t">謙</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0017" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t">公讓</persName>，晉平原內史<persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0025" ref="69h_uhy_hta">陸機</persName>姊夫。祖<persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0031" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t_*A">崇</persName>，大司農。父<persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p001:m0038" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t_*AA">黃老</persName>，司徒左西掾。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-081-gujizhi-shanyin-ancestry:p002:m0000" ref="i9w_mm6_m7t_*AAA">覬之</persName>理繁以約，縣用無事，晝日垂簾，門階閑寂，自宋世為山陰，務簡而績修，莫能尚也。</p>
</text>
